    "response": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nConnection: close\r\nCache-Control: private, must-revalidate\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\r\nDate: Thu, 12 Feb 2026 04:33:26 GMT\r\nExpires: -1\r\nPragma: no-cache\r\nServer: nginx\r\nSet-Cookie: XSRF-%3D; expires=Thu, 12 Feb 2026 06:33:26 GMT; Max-Age=7200; path=/; secure; samesite=lax\r\nSet-Cookie: nitda_innovation_platform_%3D; expires=Thu, 12 Feb 2026 06:33:26 GMT; Max-Age=7200; path=/; httponly; samesite=lax\r\nVary: Accept-Encoding\r\nX-Powered-By: PHP/8.4.17\r\nX-Powered-By: PleskLin\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n        <title>Home</title>\n\n        <!-- Bootstrap CSS & Icons -->\n        <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n        <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n        <!-- Custom CSS -->\n            <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng/assets/website/css/landing.css\">\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng/assets/website/css/main.css\">\n    </head>\n    <body>\n\n        <!-- Navbar -->\n        <nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-white border-bottom\">\n                <div class=\"container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\">\n    <!-- Logo -->\n    <a class=\"navbar-brand fw-bold d-flex align-items-center me-auto\" href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng\">\n      <img src=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng/assets/website/img/nitda_i2i.png\" alt=\"NITDA Logo\" class=\"logo-img\">\n    </a>\n\n    <!-- Toggle button for mobile -->\n    <button class=\"navbar-toggler ms-auto\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarNav\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n    </button>\n\n    <!-- Collapsible Nav -->\n     <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-between\" id=\"navbarNav\">\n      <!-- Centered Nav Links -->\n      <ul class=\"navbar-nav mx-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0\">\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng\">Home</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng/challenges\">Challenges</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng#about\">About</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng#timeline\">Timeline</a></li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <!-- Auth Buttons (visible on all screens) -->\n      <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                        <a href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng/login\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary me-2\">Login</a>\n              <a href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng/register\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Register</a>\n                </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>        </nav>\n\n        \n    <section class=\"hero text-center bg-light\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1 class=\"fw-bold\">Transform Ideas into Impact</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead mt-3\">Join Nigeria's premier innovation challenge platform to solve real-world problems, collaborate with talented individuals, and bring your innovative solutions to life.</p>\n        <div class=\"mt-4\">\n            <div class=\"d-grid gap-3 d-md-flex justify-content-md-center\">\n                <a href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng/register\" class=\"btn btn-hero me-2\">Join the Challenge</a>\n                <a href=\"https://innovation.nitda.gov.ng/challenges\" class=\"btn btn-outline-hero\">View Challenges</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- How It Works -->\n    <section class=\"py-5 text-center how-it-works\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2 class=\"fw-bold\">How It Works</h2>\n        <p class=\"mb-5\">Four simple steps to transform your ideas into reality</p>\n        <div class=\"row g-4\">\n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\n            <div class=\"icon-circle mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"bi bi-person-plus\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h5>Register & Join</h5>\n            <p>Create your account and become part of our innovation community</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\n            <div class=\"icon-circle mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"bi bi-people\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h5>Form Teams</h5>\n            <p>Collaborate with others to bring diverse skills and perspectives</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\n            <div class=\"icon-circle mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h5>Submit Ideas</h5>\n            <p>Present your innovative solutions to real-world challenges</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\n            <div class=\"icon-circle mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"bi bi-trophy\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h5>Get Judged</h5>\n            <p>Receive expert feedback and compete for recognition and prizes</p>\n        </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- About -->\n    <section class=\"py-5 bg-light\" id=\"about\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row g-4\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n                <h2 class=\"fw-bold\">About NITDA Idea to Impact</h2>\n                <p>The NITDA Idea to Impact is designed to build the culture of innovation and harness the creative potential of the Agency's staff, Corp members and Industrial Training students. It provides a platform for them to ideate, solve and innovate on challenges that accelerate NITDA\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s productivity and superior performance, thereby positioning NITDA at the forefront of 