=\"fw-bold\">How It Works</h2>\n        <p class=\"mb-5\">Four simple steps to transform your ideas into reality</p>\n        <div class=\"row g-4\">\n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\n            <div class=\"icon-circle mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"bi bi-person-plus\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h5>Register & Join</h5>\n            <p>Create your account and become part of our innovation community</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\n            <div class=\"icon-circle mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"bi bi-people\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h5>Form Teams</h5>\n            <p>Collaborate with others to bring diverse skills and perspectives</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\n            <div class=\"icon-circle mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"bi bi-lightbulb\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h5>Submit Ideas</h5>\n            <p>Present your innovative solutions to real-world challenges</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-3\">\n            <div class=\"icon-circle mb-3\">\n            <i class=\"bi bi-trophy\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h5>Get Judged</h5>\n            <p>Receive expert feedback and compete for recognition and prizes</p>\n        </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- About -->\n    <section class=\"py-5 bg-light\" id=\"about\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row g-4\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n                <h2 class=\"fw-bold\">About NITDA Idea to Impact</h2>\n                <p>The NITDA Idea to Impact is designed to build the culture of innovation and harness the creative potential of the Agency's staff, Corp members and Industrial Training students. It provides a platform for them to ideate, solve and innovate on challenges that accelerate NITDA\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s productivity and superior performance, thereby positioning NITDA at the forefront of the digital economy growth.</p>\n                <p>Our mission is to foster a culture of innovation, support technological advancement, and create sustainable solutions that empower the Agency to drive digital transformation in Nigeria.  </p>\n                <ul class=\"list-unstyled feature-list\">\n                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span>Community-driven challenge selection</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span>Expert judging and mentorship</span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span>Prizes and implementation support</span>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white shadow-sm eligibility\">\n                    <h4>Who Can Participate</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"list-unstyled feature-list mt-3\">\n                        <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                                <i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i>\n                            </div>\n                            <span>Interested Staff</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-2\">\n                            <div class=\"icon-circle me-2\">\n                       